{"ref":"BDB, פְּלִילִי","hw":"פְּלִילִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלִילִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. for a judge, calling for judgment</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">עָוֹן פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:28\" href=\"/Job.31.28\">Jb 31:28</a> (on v <a data-ref=\"Job 31:11\" href=\"/Job.31.11\">11</a> see <a data-ref=\"BDB, פָּלִיל\" href=\"/BDB,_פָּלִיל\", dir=\"rtl\">פָּלִיל</a>; Kue <sup>Ond. (2) 161</sup> reads <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲוֹן פְּלִילִים</span> in both v <a data-ref=\"Job 31:11\" href=\"/Job.31.11\">11</a> and v <a data-ref=\"Job 31:28\" href=\"/Job.31.28\">28</a>).","next":"BDB, פְּלִילִיָּה","prev":"BDB, פְּלִילָה"}